27437 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Paradox of the Public Ledger\072\nAll Can See It\054 But Not All Can Read It)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 27438 0 R
     /Pg 1980 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
