27481 0 obj
  << /ActualText (False positives arising in this process \024 errors in which addresses belonging to distinct entities are incorrectly grouped into the same entity \024 can undermine the reliability of the analysis as a whole\056 Cybersecurity researchers Kelvin Lubbertsen\054 Michel van Eeten\054 and Rolf van Wegberg verified the effectiveness of blockchain analytics techniques using server data obtained from actual illicit services\056 Their study found that Chainalysis\047s clustering accuracy varies considerably depending on the type of service being analyzed\056 True positive rates ranged widely by service\054 from 24\05654\045 for Bestmixer to 94\05685\045 for Wall Street Market\054 while false positive rates remained below 0\05615\045 in all cases\0564\051 This means that labels assigned by analytics firms can function as a reliable lower bound\054 but it cannot be assumed that unlabeled addresses are necessarily unrelated to illicit services\056 This limitation remains a challenge across the industry\054 and ongoing efforts to improve accuracy continue through machine learning\054 integration with external datasets\054 and real\055time address verification in cooperation with exchange partners\056\n\nThe second stage\054 labeling\054 is the process of assigning identity to addresses or entities grouped through clustering\056 If clustering creates a shape\054 labeling is the stage that assigns a name and role to it\056 The outputs of labeling include classifying a particular cluster as the hot wallet of a global exchange\054 an OTC desk\054 or a ransomware\055linked address\056 Labeling is carried out primarily through three methods\056 Partnership\055based labeling \024 directly labeling wallet address data received through cooperation with exchanges or financial institutions \024 carries the highest reliability\056 Behavioral labeling is used when official data is unavailable\072 on\055chain behavioral characteristics such as transaction frequency\054 deposit and withdrawal patterns\054 and mixer usage are analyzed to infer patterns\056 A confidence score is then assigned to quantify the reliability of each label and indicate the degree to which it can be trusted\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 27482 0 R
     /Pg 2897 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

