27525 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Founded in 2003 under the leadership of PayPal co\055founder Peter Thiel\054 Palantir Technologies was never an ordinary startup\056 In 2005\054 the company received an initial investment of \0441\05625 million from In\055Q\055Tel\054 the venture capital arm of the CIA\056 More importantly\054 the CIA directly participated in improving Gotham\054 Palantir\047s first software product\054 and became one of its earliest major customers\0565\051\n\nPalantir was not merely a company that received government funding\056 It was a company whose software was co\055developed with a state intelligence agency from the design stage onward\056 This starting point defined the company\047s nature\056 Although formally a private enterprise\054 Palantir was born out of the needs of the state\056\n\nPalantir\047s flagship platform\054 Gotham\054 is designed to integrate and analyze vast quantities of heterogeneous data within a single environment\056 Arrest records\054 license\055plate recognition data\054 immigration records\054 social media activity\054 and numerous other fragmented datasets that were previously held separately by different agencies are brought together and transformed into searchable information\056 Law\055enforcement agencies and government analysts use the platform to map social networks\054 track movements\054 identify individuals through physical characteristics\054 and review criminal histories\056 Tasks that once required weeks of cross\055checking across separate systems can now be completed within hours\0566\051\n\nBy 2025\054 Palantir generated approximately \0441\056855 billion in revenue from the U\056S\056 government\054 accounting for roughly 41 percent of its total revenue of \0444\056475 billion\0567\051\n\nThe structure demonstrated by Palantir is both simple and powerful\056 Rather than merely selling software to government agencies\054 the company embeds engineers within those agencies and jointly develops customized tools for tracking terrorist networks\054 criminal activity\054 and financial fraud\056 Technology and state power were not separate\073 they were designed from the outset as parts of the same ecosystem\056 Palantir provided a clear illustration of how that ecosystem operates\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 27526 0 R
     /Pg 4108 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

