27611 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Lazarus\047s money laundering process was traced across five stages\056 In the first stage\054 the stolen ETH was dispersed across multiple intermediary wallets\054 severing any direct connection to the initial point of theft\056 In the second stage\054 large volumes of ETH were mixed through the mixer service14\051 Tornado Cash\054 concealing the origin of the funds\056 In the third stage\054 ETH withdrawn from Tornado Cash was exchanged for BTC\054 raising the difficulty of tracing\056 In the fourth stage\054 the exchanged BTC was sent through another round of mixing services\054 performing a second layer of laundering\056 In the fifth and final stage\054 the laundered BTC was converted into fiat currency and cashed out\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 27612 0 R
     /Pg 5822 0 R
