27619 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The findings of Chainalysis and Elliptic translated directly into policy action\056 The U\056S\056 Treasury Department\047s Office of Foreign Assets Control \050OFAC\051 drew on blockchain analytics data to impose OFAC sanctions on Tornado Cash in August 2022\05615\051 The designation of a decentralized\054 smart\055contract\055based mixer service was an unprecedented move\05616\051 This case clearly demonstrated that blockchain analytics can function not merely as an investigative support tool but as intelligence that directly underpins the state\047s sanctions policy\056\n\nFollowing the Tornado Cash sanctions\054 Lazarus changed its strategy\056 No longer relying on the well\055known Ethereum\055based mixer\054 it began making active use of various decentralized                 \176)
