27683 0 obj
  << /ActualText (funds of unknown origin began flowing out of the system in abnormal patterns\056 It was impossible to determine immediately who was moving the funds or for what purpose\054 and market distrust reached an extreme\056\n\nIn the midst of this chaos\054 blockchain analysis operated as a central tool\056 Elliptic traced and published the laundering routes of the stolen funds through its own independent public analysis\056 It was found that the stolen funds had moved through decentralized exchanges such as Uniswap and PancakeSwap\054 then on to cross\055chain bridges such as RenBridge\054 before being laundered through mixer services including ChipMixer and Sinbad\05616\051 The identified wallets were immediately labeled and shared with major exchanges worldwide\054 enabling the rapid construction of a defensive system to block the inflow of suspicious funds\056 Blockchain analytics data ultimately served as decisive evidence in court\054 used to substantiate the fraud and embezzlement charges against Sam Bankman\055Fried\05620\051)
