  << /ActualText (In this case\054 blockchain analytics data was shared rapidly with investigative and regulatory agencies across multiple countries\054 enabling key hub jurisdictions \024 including Hong Kong and Singapore \024 to cooperate in real time on the basis of the same blockchain analytics data without any lag\056 As a result\054 the movement route of the stolen funds was mapped in concrete detail\056 The funds were found to have passed through a Hong Kong\055based trader\054 through various bridges and mixers\054 before being ultimately cashed out through Huione Pay\054 a subsidiary of Cambodia\047s Huione Group\05623\051 This analysis subsequently became one of the decisive grounds on which the U\056S\056 FinCEN designated Huione Pay as a subject of special measures\05624\051)
     /K [ 4 ]
