27777 0 obj
  << /ActualText (his associates\054 and affiliated entities\05628\051 Not only the United States but also the United Kingdom froze real estate owned by Chen Zhi in London\054 and in November 2025 South Korea joined the international effort by sanctioning 15 individuals and 132 organizations including Prince Group and Chen Zhi\056 Chen Zhi was arrested in Cambodia on January 6\054 2026 and extradited to China\05629\051\n\nNotably\054 according to Chainalysis\054 even after sanctions were imposed on Chen Zhi\054 the addresses under his control continued laundering remaining assets on\055chain until his arrest\05630\051 The fact that on\055chain fund movements did not stop even after sanctions were issued demonstrates that while blockchain analytics enables tracing\054 it still has limits when it comes to real\055time interdiction\056 What this case reveals is both the limitation and the potential of blockchain analytics technology\056 On\055chain data alone cannot identify a criminal from the outset\056 But the moment it is combined with investigators\047 off\055chain intelligence\054 blockchain analytics becomes a decisive weapon for tracing and containing criminal funds worth tens of billions of dollars\056 This case most clearly illustrates that the cooperation between state investigative agencies and private analytics firms is evolving beyond the mere provision of tools into a three\055dimensional investigative architecture\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 27778 0 R
     /Pg 9413 0 R
     /S /Span
