  << /ActualText (The cases examined above showed how blockchain analytics technology works\056 The question now shifts\056 How has that technology contributed to the institutionalization of crypto\077 Institutionalization begins only when something can be traced\054 when intervention becomes possible\054 and when it can be connected to the real legal order\056)
