27993 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The United States embraced crypto because it gained the confidence that crypto could be managed\054 and because it arrived at the strategic judgment that doing so could reinforce dollar hegemony\056 The technical foundation of that confidence and that strategic judgment is blockchain analytics infrastructure\056 Only when the traces left by blockchain can be read does institutionalization become possible\056 And institutionalization does not end simply with the imposition of a regulatory framework\056 It changes the vocabulary\054 the structure\054 and the meaning\056 Crypto still exists\054 but what it means has changed fundamentally\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 27994 0 R
     /Pg 13370 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
