28021 0 obj
  << /ActualText (reflected in Chainalysis\047s labeling\054 and that labeling becomes the standard shared by more than 1\054500 investigative agencies\054 financial institutions\054 and exchanges worldwide\056 When the United States decides on a sanction\054 that sanction is immediately propagated throughout the global crypto ecosystem through Chainalysis\056 This structure is extending into the Bitcoin network itself\056 Following the approval of the spot Bitcoin ETF\054 more than one million Bitcoin have become concentrated in U\056S\056 financial institutions such as BlackRock and Fidelity\05646\051 Bitcoin moves from address to address\054 leaving traces\056 The more major addresses are held by U\056S\056 financial institutions\054 the more of Bitcoin\047s fund flows come within range of American surveillance\056 The technical possibility of applying to the Bitcoin network the same method used to weaponize the dollar \024 freezing sanctioned addresses \024 is becoming structurally achievable\056 The fact that the authority to interpret on\055chain data is concentrated in U\056S\056\055centered analytics infrastructure means that the geopolitics of crypto continues to run along the same lines as the geopolitics of dollar hegemony\056 Who controls the on\055chain narrative controls the story\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 28022 0 R
